{
  "body" : "You are designing a whimsical animal illustration with expressive brushstroke textures and a playful atmosphere.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Illustration subject: {{character}}\n- Background or setting: {{backdrop}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: painterly animal illustration with expressive brushstrokes\n- Composition: centered subject with ample white negative space, subject scale medium within the frame\n- Lens / camera: NA (illustration, no lens-based traits)\n- Lighting: soft and diffuse, implied through color contrast rather than directional rendering\n- Color palette and grading: warm tones for the subject, complementary blues for the background, balanced saturation\n- Texture / surface: prominent brushstroke textures, visible paint application\n- Post-processing: clean and refined edges, no digital effects\n- Mood: whimsical, playful, lighthearted\n- References: Studio Ghibli-inspired character warmth, traditional hand-painted animal art\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 1:1 square (~1024×1024) suitable for social media posts and decorative prints\n- Prominent subject isolation against a textured backdrop\n- Whiteness of negative space emphasizes surrounding brushstroke textures\n\nAVOID\n- No sharp or harsh digital outlines\n- No overly busy or cluttered backgrounds\n- No photorealistic rendering\n- No muted or overly desaturated colors\n- No rigid symmetry or geometric patterns\n- No artificial gradients or stock effects\n- No typography or text overlays on the illustration\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nIllustration subject: {{character}}\nBackground or setting: {{backdrop}}\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}",
